# What the Vercel deployment carries: the page (web/), the v86 ES modules the page imports
# (v86/src, v86/lib), the wasm and the BIOSes, and exactly the disk image + boot snapshot named
# by image/current.json. tools/deploy.sh rewrites the two stamped image lines from current.json.
